("v277", "key", "text")
("v278", "type", "String")
("v278", "scalar", "A trailer rendered entirely from code: a sky computed pixel by pixel, lights that leave trails, the commandments set in type, and a drone synthesised from sine waves and noise. This edition preserves the original film, its captions and its recorded provenance.")
