("v289", "key", "text")
("v290", "type", "String")
("v290", "scalar", "The original film was made with a separate rendering pipeline. A choreography file set the scenes, lights, sparks and chimes; Python, ffmpeg and headless Chrome produced the picture and sound. This edition retains the rendered files and their manifest.")
("v289", "value", "v290")
